; Regression test for issue #3278 through an automated transaction.
;
; When an automated transaction adds postings that must balance, the
; extended transaction is checked again by xact_base_t::verify(), which
; widens a cost commodity of display precision 0 by the same rule as
; finalize().  It too must honor the precision of 0 that -1 IHGfreenight
; teaches, rather than demand that the cost of 12000 IHG equal 1
; IHGfreenight to all 32 places of its per-unit price.

= /^Expenses:Hotels$/
    Expenses:Points:Valuation        0.5
    Equity:Points:Valuation         -0.5

2023-09-25 * IHG free night redemption
    Expenses:Hotels         12000 IHG @ 0.00008333333333333333333333333333 IHGfreenight
    Assets:Rewards          -1 IHGfreenight

test bal
     -1 IHGfreenight  Assets:Rewards
           -6000 IHG  Equity:Points:Valuation
           18000 IHG  Expenses
           12000 IHG    Hotels
            6000 IHG    Points:Valuation
--------------------
           12000 IHG
     -1 IHGfreenight
end test
